{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/6803d20d4e299c259670f55bbfa8d76d.poster.avif?t=1758991876\" width=780 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/6803d20d4e299c259670f55bbfa8d76d.webm?t=1758991876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/6803d20d4e299c259670f55bbfa8d76d.mp4?t=1758991876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astrolite is a Hybrid Bullet-Hell Roguelite Game built off of Atari Asteroid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgrades are earned in-game strengthening you as you survive as long as possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Elemental Powers that allow unique playstyles, single target, AoE, stacking buffs, the elemental bonuses allow for tons of unique runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale to unfathomable degrees, with unique modifiers combined with lucky upgrades to have hilarious runs, bullets the size of your screen, elemental powers taking the reins and allowing you to idle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Tree choices exist to ensure you continue growing ever more powerful as you progress with infinite Galactica Levels bringing unique twists and challenges alongside them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/ac2a809ace3a893b711e294e766044e2.poster.avif?t=1758991876\" width=780 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/ac2a809ace3a893b711e294e766044e2.webm?t=1758991876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/ac2a809ace3a893b711e294e766044e2.mp4?t=1758991876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Power up your Sentry companion, with an exclusive skill tree devoted to making your buddy as powerful as can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play, lose, and progress through the world of Asteroid, with modern gameplay elements!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3450850?t=1758991876","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/c70e80453bafd9cdfaf9525e82f9ed99c3bd568f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758991876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/b3805759574233e8a7e04b13e662999f1406a003/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758991876","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/b3805759574233e8a7e04b13e662999f1406a003/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758991876","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/6803d20d4e299c259670f55bbfa8d76d.poster.avif?t=1758991876\" width=780 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/6803d20d4e299c2